cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this transcription or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "excursoria: a Prolog reading of the index to Flora Excursoria Hafniensis (1838)"
abstract: >-
  A transcription of the 903-name index to Salomon Thomas Nicolai Drejer's
  Flora Excursoria Hafniensis (Kjøbenhavn, 1838), with a Prolog reading of it.
  The index interfiles Latin and Danish plant names in one alphabetical
  sequence and prints no translations; because a plant's Latin and Danish
  names were set on the same page, the page number works as a join key and
  part of the pairing is recoverable. The repository also states the five
  collation rules that recover the printed order, and the eight inversions that
  remain, one of them by design.
